ive leads. New leads will not be created. Leads that have completed all their actions will not be updated.\u003c/p\u003e\n","required":false,"allow_nil":false,"allow_blank":false,"validator":"Must be a boolean value: 1, true, yes, on, 0, false, no, off","expected_type":"boolean","metadata":null,"show":true,"validations":[],"deprecated":false},{"name":"lead_priority","full_name":"lead_priority","description":"\n\u003cp\u003eDefines the lead’s priority for processing. Leads with lower values are processed first, influencing the order of scheduled actions such as calls, SMS, emails, and more.\u003c/p\u003e\n","required":false,"allow_nil":false,"allow_blank":false,"validator":"Must be a decimal number.","expected_type":"numeric","metadata":null,"show":true,"validations":[],"deprecated":false},{"name":"restart_schedule","full_name":"restart_schedule","description":"\n\u003cp\u003eRestart the schedule for the lead from the beginning.\u003c/p\u003e\n","required":false,"allow_nil":false,"allow_blank":false,"validator":"Must be a boolean value: 1, true, yes, on, 0, false, no, off","expected_type":"boolean","metadata":null,"show":true,"validations":[],"deprecated":false},{"name":"auto_format_nested_fields","full_name":"auto_format_nested_fields","description":"\n\u003cp\u003eAutomatically extract contact fields that are nested inside non-standard incoming POST.\u003c/p\u003e\n","required":false,"allow_nil":false,"allow_blank":false,"validator":"Must be a boolean value: 1, true, yes, on, 0, false, no, off","expected_type":"boolean","metadata":null,"show":true,"validations":[],"deprecated":false},{"name":"next_action_at","full_name":"next_action_at","description":"\n\u003cp\u003eChange when the next action is scheduled to run. EG If you mistakenly scheduled leads to wait until next week, you can use this to bulk update them to run 1 second from now.\u003c/p\u003e\n","required":false,"allow_nil":false,"allow_blank":false,"validator":"Must be a valid time: 2026-10-08 15:57:42 +00